hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"316","[AI-translation] Haddathana Qutaibah, qala: Haddathana Al-Laith, 'an Mu'awiyah bin Salih, 'an 'Abdullah bin Abi Qais, qala: Maine 'Aishah se poocha, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki qira'at ke bare mein, kya Aap dheemi awaz mein padhte the ya buland awaz mein? Unhon ne farmaya: Aap yeh sab karte the. Kabhi Aap dheemi awaz mein padhte aur kabhi buland awaz mein. Toh maine kaha: Alhamdulillah, jisne is amr mein wus'at rakhi."
"317","[AI-translation] Haddathana Mahmud bin Ghailan, qala: Haddathana Waki', qala: Haddathana Mis'ar, 'an Abi Al-'Alaa Al-'Abdi, 'an Yahya bin Ja'dah, 'an Umm Hani', qalat: Main raat mein Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki qira'at suna karti thi jab main apne chhat par hoti thi."
